# ============================================================
# AppointUnified V1 — Root Environment Template
# Copy to .env for local Docker Compose / Next.js development.
#
# Required today:
# - Neon PostgreSQL
# - JWT secret
# - Firebase Admin + Firebase web config (if using Firebase auth flow)
# - SendGrid SMTP API key
# - Cloudinary credentials
#
# Optional / future integrations:
# - Upstash Redis
# - Twilio / Resend / WhatsApp Cloud API
# - Mapbox / OpenRouteService / Geoapify
# - Auth0 / Clerk / Supabase
# ============================================================

